        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Allowable expense means any charge, up to the maximum allowable fees incurred during a year and while eligible for benefits under the Scheduled Dental Plan, Preferred Dental Plan, or Prepaid Dental Plan part or all of which would be covered under any of the plans.",
