            "block_content": "1. Actively at work means the employee is attending to his or her normal duties at the assigned place of employment. On a holiday, vacation day, weekend day, or other regularly scheduled day off, actively at work means the employee is not ill, injured, or otherwise disabled or confined to a hospital or similar institution, and is performing the normal activities of a person of his or her gender and age.",
